=2 Walkthrough
* Examine the **Qe'Iov Gate** in {z:Stellar Fulcrum} for a cutscene.
* Examine it again to begin the **Ode of Life Bestowing** fight.

=3 Fight
Your opponent will be a {m:Seed Crystal}.
* Instead of normal melee attacks, it has a ranged AoE magic-type attack. It will also frequently {p:Draw-In} whoever holds primary hate.
** Has approximately 25,000 HP.
** Has both strong Physical and Magical Defense.
** Can cast: {s:Stonega III}, {s:Waterga III}, {s:Aeroga III}, {s:Thundaga III}, {s:Firaga III}, {s:Blizzaga III}
** Has {p:Draw In}.
** Special Attacks:
*** **Seed of Nihility:** AoE Damage low damage. It also causes all job ability timers on all party members to be set to their maximum recast within range of the move. This includes {p:2hr abilities|Two-Hour}.
*** **Seed of Deference:** AoE {p:Charm}, any player charmed by this move is put in a {m:Seed Mandragora} costume.
*** **Seed of Deception:** Makes a clone of targeted player called "Seed Thrall" and it will attack the player that has hate. Uses this move quite frequently during the fight.
*** **Seed of Judgment:** Knock-back AoE high damage.

=2 "A Crystalline Prophecy" Key
* Re-obtain an {@k} {k:Omnis Stone} from the previous mission.
** Alternatively, {@k} {k:Omnis Stone} can be purchased from {n:Squintrox Dryeyes} for 2000g and 20 {i:Beastmen's Seals|Beastmen's Seal|1126} after all {p:Crystalline Missions|Category:Crystalline Missions} are completed.
* Repeat the mission as described above to receive another {@k} {k:Ebon Key}.
* Use the {@k} {k:Ebon Key} (Level 75) to open the red treasure coffer at {z:Lower Jeuno} (J-8).
** Rewards are listed on the {p:Add-on Scenario Rewards} page.

